Description:You control Eshki Dragonclaw, a Forest and an Island, and have Ornithopter, Grizzly Bears and Opt in hand. It is your first main phase. End the turn with two +1/+1 counters on Eshki Dragonclaw.
Rule:cranial-insertion-2d24db6175393663 | A creature spell is never a noncreature spell, whatever its other types (CR 205.2, 302.1): Ornithopter and Grizzly Bears are two creature spells, so Eshki needs Ornithopter with Opt
